{"3579250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "RAD CTRL", "steam_appid": 3579250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RAD CTRL is a chill VR multiplayer game featuring realistic RC car physics in fun environments.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic physics recreates the challenge and fun of driving RC cars around any environment. Hangout with your friends, or meet new ones, with the best light-competitive VR multiplayer racer!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🏁 Features in Early Access:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic RC Car Physics</strong> – Dialed-in handling that captures the twitchy, responsive feel of real RC racers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 Unique Tracks</strong> – Tear through tight corners and catch air across a variety of track types, with more in the works.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Unique RC Cars</strong> – From nimble buggies to high-speed racers, every car has its own style and performance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Solo or with Friends</strong> – Race alone or compete online with up to 10 players.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 Game Modes</strong> – Hop into Race mode or stunt your cars in Freestyle mode—more modes are planned as development continues.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Everything</strong> – Tweak your RC car setup, design your own liveries, and fine-tune your transmitter for a personal touch.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\